@@ ============================================================
@@ Tadd — integer addition, 100000 times
@@ Interpreter baseline: no array is involved anywhere.
@@ Returns the elapsed time in milliseconds.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : none   ( -- duration )
@@ ============================================================
	« 1 100000 FOR i 1 2 + DROP NEXT » TEVAL
